### Angular repair-workspace backend smoke requests (JWT — Stage 7)
### Use tokens from POST /api/auth/login. Populate variables below.
@base = http://localhost:8081/api
@companyId = 1
@repairId = 1
@employeeUserId = 2
@itemId = 1
@customerToken = REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@managerToken = REPLACE_WITH_MANAGER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@employeeToken = REPLACE_WITH_ASSIGNED_EMPLOYEE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Customer creates a repair
POST {{base}}/companies/{{companyId}}/repairs
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deviceType":"Mobile phone","brand":"Samsung","model":"Galaxy S24","issueDescription":"Touch screen not working"}

### Customer lists their own repairs (cost fields absent)
GET {{base}}/companies/{{companyId}}/repairs/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Manager sees company's repair queue
GET {{base}}/companies/{{companyId}}/repairs
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Manager lists staff (use response `userId`, not membership `id`)
GET {{base}}/companies/{{companyId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Manager assigns employee
PUT {{base}}/companies/{{companyId}}/repairs/{{repairId}}/assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"employeeId":{{employeeUserId}}}

### Assigned employee diagnoses repair
POST {{base}}/companies/{{companyId}}/repairs/{{repairId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"DIAGNOSING","note":"Checking device"}

### Assigned employee views available stock
GET {{base}}/companies/{{companyId}}/inventory/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### Assigned employee uses a part
POST {{base}}/companies/{{companyId}}/repairs/{{repairId}}/parts
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"itemId":{{itemId}},"quantity":1}

### Manager updates labor charge and cost
PUT {{base}}/companies/{{companyId}}/repairs/{{repairId}}/labor
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"laborCharge":100.00,"laborCost":35.00}

### Customer detail should not expose laborCost / partsCost / estimatedGrossProfit
GET {{base}}/companies/{{companyId}}/repairs/{{repairId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Manager finalized repair profit summary
GET {{base}}/companies/{{companyId}}/finance/repair-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
